# W31e, c (k10): joins a in stag0201, goes on to stag0202 (matz00) and, as soon as a's offer shows (a went into
# dng204b1), into dng205b1 (stag0202's matz01, by the development step depart: c plays stag0202 alone).
# (Run b1: the mummies of stag0201 felled c on its way to matz00, so it heals from the L panel at 350 HP now; run c1:
# stag0202's enemies felled it on its way to matz01 with two heals.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until frames>=600
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@600
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@600
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@600
log c in stag0202
idle until offers>=1 fail epoch>=@900
depart dng205b1 0 until stage=dng205b1,control fail epoch>=@960
log c in dng205b1
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@1400
log b joined c
